```
id: SPL-009
name: MFA fatigue: repeated MFA denials
description: Many MFA denials or time-outs for one user in a short window.
platform: Splunk
mitre_tactic: Credential Access
mitre_technique: T1621 Multi-Factor Authentication Request Generation
severity: High
data_source: index=azure (sign-in logs)
false_positives: Broken authenticator app or poor connectivity.
tuning: Raise the threshold; mark High when a success follows within one hour.
test_method: Deny or ignore five MFA prompts for a lab user.
owner: <OWNER>
status: Draft
last_review: 2026-11-19
```
index=azure sourcetype="mscs:azure:eventhub" category=SignInLogs "properties.status.errorCode"=500121 earliest=-1h
| eval user='properties.userPrincipalName', src_ip='properties.ipAddress'
| bin _time span=10m
| stats count AS denials values(src_ip) AS source_ips BY _time, user
| where denials>=5
| sort - denials
